OL,3,GNEWSAWorks on #10.6bn Lower Thames
OL,4,ACrossing progress
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first physical signs of the Lower
OL,7,FThames Crossing are beginning to appear
OL,8,Facross Kent and Essex, as work gets
OL,9,Funder way on the huge project.
OL,11,FThe BBC has been given exclusive access
OL,12,Fto see some of the early preparation
OL,13,Fwork, including the creation of a new
OL,14,Fwetland, new roads for construction
OL,15,Ftraffic and preparations are for the
OL,16,Ftunnel beneath the River Thames.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
