OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWorks on #10.6bn Lower Thames
OL,4,ACrossing progress
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways has said the Lower
OL,7,FThames crossing, a 14.5-mile (23km)
OL,8,Froad linking Essex and Kent via two
OL,9,Ftunnels underneath the river, will be
OL,10,Fthe greenest large scale construction
OL,11,Fbuilt in the UK.
OL,13,FBut environmental campaigners have
OL,14,Fraised concerns about the loss of
OL,15,Fancient woodland and traffic
OL,16,Fcongestion.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
